      "source": "Start creating new <a href=\"VariableOperators.Let.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>VariableOperators.Let</code></a> that allows definition of <a href=\"VariableOperators.Let.ExpressionVariable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>VariableOperators.Let.ExpressionVariable</code></a> that can be used within a\nnested <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>.",
      "translation": "开始创建新的<a href=\"VariableOperators.Let.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>VariableOperators.Let</code></a>，它允许定义<a href=\"VariableOperators.Let.ExpressionVariable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>VariableOperators.Let.ExpressionVariable</code></a>，该变量可在嵌套的<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>中使用。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Starts building new <a href=\"VariableOperators.Map.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>VariableOperators.Map</code></a> that applies an <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> to each item of a referenced array\nand returns an array with the applied results.",
      "translation": "开始构建新的<a href=\"VariableOperators.Map.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>VariableOperators.Map</code></a>，该操作将<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>应用于引用数组的每个元素，并返回包含应用结果的数组。",
      "count": 4
